  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 200°C."
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix all the vegetables with the olive oil, tomato paste, harissa, ras el hanout, salt and pepper in a bowl and spread in a baking dish or a tray lined with baking paper. Cover with foil."
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake for about 30 minutes until the vegetables are tender to your liking. If you like, remove the foil and bake for another 10 minutes to brown."
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour boiling water over the couscous according to the packet instructions, cover and leave to stand. Uncover and fluff the grains with a fork."
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve the couscous with the hot or room temperature vegetables, with tahini and/or yoghurt if you like."
    }
  ]
